            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Menu bar icon</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>The ring no longer follows the order of the list.</strong> It has one sector per checked service, at most 10. Clockwise from 12 o'clock come the problems, worst first — outage, degraded, maintenance, unreachable — each taking a share for how many services have it; the rest is green. Reordering services in Settings now changes only the menu.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
